<<if get_flag("docs") and get_flag("log")>>
	Zoe looks up at you, stoic as always
	Zoe: Good Job. I'll file the extension when I go back to the office.
	Sully: That's great kid! I glad you were able to make it in time
		-> How much is the extension? 
			Zoe: It last a week. so be quick in organizing this funeral thing.
		-> Thanks
	<<if set_flag("gotExtension")>><<endif>>
